    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d506-a1">

                <pb facs="0608" n="588" xml:id="pg588"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 1.</seg></opener>
                <head>Japanese Ministers to Mr. Pruyn</head>
                <p>We beg to communicate to you as follows:</p>
                <p>In respect to the convention entered into by our vice-minister, Saka
                    Hida-no-kami, on the 22d ultimo, with you, at Kanagawa, we have to inform you
                    that our government has undertaken to give effect to the same; in token of which
                    we send this despatch.</p>
                <p>In order to inform you of the above we send this communication.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">With respect and esteem, <date
                            calendar="japanese-nengō gregorian" when="1864-11-04">the 3d day of the
                            10th month of 1st year Genji, (4th November, 1864</date>.)</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MIDSUMO IDSUMI-NO-KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>ABE BUNGO-NO-KAMI.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert H. Pruyn</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States, &amp;c.,
                            &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
